hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan today I'm  going to answer question from one of my  newsletter reader Stella who was asking  me what programs I might recommend for  her to make money from home if it's  filling out surveys or writing articles  she really wants to make money from her  computer and an internet connection and  what would I advised her to do so Stella  I don't know if I have good news for you  or not here I don't have a  get-rich-quick kind of strategy for you  I don't really think those exist or at  least I haven't found one for myself yet  it's really going to come down to adding  a lot of value so if you can find a  customer where you can add a ton of  value to that's how much you're going to  get paid so the more value can add to  somebody the more you're going to get  paid so is filling out surveys gonna add  a lot of value probably not so you're  not going to make a lot of money that  way writing articles maybe depending on  the type of article and its really good  at writing and you're having a lot of  value then you might get paid well for  that so I wouldn't necessarily start  looking for kind of these get-rich-quick  home business type of ideas I look for a  way that you can add a lot of value to  your customer and then see if that  relates to you know writing articles or  research or whatever it is my other  advice for you here would be to try to  go and target a business if you could  target a business owner and you're  giving them value as a service they're  going to want to hire you back for more  keep giving you more projects you become  an important part of their business you  get repeat business and often much  bigger deals where if you're targeting a  consumer market it's a lot harder to get  repeat business and when it is they're  kind of small chunks it's hard to make a  living off of it so still I don't know  if that helps probably not the news that  you wanted to hear from me on this one  but if you can add a lot of value to  somebody's business then you're gonna be  able to make a lot of money and you can  do that working from home absolutely so  I hope that helps if you guys liked the  video please give it a thumbs up or  leave a comment below I'd love to hear  what you guys have to say it also helps  motivate me to make more of these videos  for you guys so I really appreciate it  when I see those likes and comments  so thank you and stay tuned the next  episode  you
 

